<theodulf. carm. 54.1>	Omnipotentis opus sacrum sacer ore popellus
<theodulf. carm. 54.2>	Laudibus efferri tam bene tale decet.
<theodulf. carm. 54.3>	Infima quod magni dignatus conditor orbis
<theodulf. carm. 54.4>	Sponte sua patier, laude boare decet.
<theodulf. carm. 54.5>	Pertulit humanae in humano denique natus
<theodulf. carm. 54.6>	Corpore quae Christus cuncta salutis erant.
